# ── Personal / health data: never commit ─────────────────────────────
# SQLite databases hold typed messages, symptom reports, alerts and a
# face-derived calibration. Use a synthetic sample database instead.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
# Evaluation recordings (facial-landmark time series) — Phase 1 / Phase B
recordings/
eval/sessions/
# Pipeline check written by `npm run eval:report -- --synthetic`: simulated numbers, never results.
eval/SYNTHETIC-CHECK.md
eval/SYNTHETIC-ABLATION.md

# ── Secrets and machine-local tool settings ──────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Out-of-scope codebases kept locally ──────────────────────────────
# archive/ holds the old platform/ rewrite (its own nested git repo,
# node_modules and a .env) and the v3 frontend.
archive/

# ── Large third-party model not used by the app ──────────────────────
# dlib 68-point model: 99.7 MB (GitHub limit is 100 MB) and trained on
# iBUG 300-W, whose licence excludes commercial use. dlib_tracker.py
# downloads it on demand.
shape_predictor_68_face_landmarks.dat

# ── Build and OS artefacts ───────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
node_modules/
